<title>USA: Universal Electronics started by NatWest.</title>
<headline>Universal Electronics started by NatWest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Securities analyst Cliff Ransom said he started Universal Electronics Inc with a buy rating, saying that with a new management team in place the company seems to be in the final stages of a turnaround.</p>
<p>&quot;Results are clearly apparent from stern measures the new team has taken to address Universal's out-of-control cost structure and the gargantuan debt the company incurred to finance eventually obsolete inventories. But progress is hardly instantaneous,&quot; Ransom said.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 7/8 to 29-5/8.</p>
</text>
